Subject: [R-sig-Fedora] rstudio-server toolbox instructions
In-Reply-To: <CALEXWq25zNSKSm45W3t+ePg=Rq0NG0LNb5mLQ2Kgy3b1Rfxe5A@mail.gmail.com>
References: <1781300216.20655.1655217107907@office.mailbox.org>
 <CALEXWq25zNSKSm45W3t+ePg=Rq0NG0LNb5mLQ2Kgy3b1Rfxe5A@mail.gmail.com>
Message-ID: <CALEXWq3SRFFY0RjxfsEj0aZ4csrAyo34gaK6AzDEtiO0d8e8ag@mail.gmail.com>

It seems that running the following once:

[toolbox]$ sudo rserver --server-user=$(whoami) --verify-installation=1

creates the necessary files, and then you can just run:

[toolbox]$ rserver --server-user=$(whoami)

Hope it helps.
I?aki

